                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "if you're a parkour platformer or creative madman platform maker, this game is for you!\n\nlike Happy Wheels, Mario Maker and other similar platformers, this is simple yet a lot of critical thinking to get through many and ridiculous obstacles. i struggled and frustrated that my brain was clocking overtime!\n\nas of going through the obstacle course, creator platformer mode is not my partake. im more of a \"Go-Getter\" than a \"Creator\" to make challenging platforms. But i'm looking forward to try out more creative platform challenges created by the creator or other users and put my skills to the test.\n\nI had fun playing this game and definitely worth it!\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KZi9DPq3ET8",
